params:query {
  ~pageFilter: capaian
  ~page: 1
  ~limit: 100
}

docs {
  # List Carousel (Admin)
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/carousel/admin`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Role Required:** Admin
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  ```typescript
  interface ListCarouselAdminQuery {
    pageFilter?: string;  // Filter halaman: "capaian" | "home"
    page?: number;        // Default: 1
    limit?: number;       // Default: 100
  }
  ```
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Default |
  |-------|------|----------|---------|
  | pageFilter | string | ❌ | - |
  | page | number | ❌ | 1 |
  | limit | number | ❌ | 100 |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil data carousel",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "title": "Banner Title",
        "image_url": "/uploads/carousel/img.jpg",
        "is_active": true,
        "page": "capaian",
        "order": 1,
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 100,
      "total": 5,
      "totalPages": 1
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Akses ditolak |
}
